0013: module M7c instrumentation (OpenGV RANSAC inputs), active only with OKVIS_PORT_RANSAC_DIR.
 One file ransac.bin (framing as problem.bin) with, per Ransac::computeModel run of the frontend, the adapter data the run sees
 (tag 163 absolute-pose adapter, 164 relative-pose adapter; layouts in okvis_port/c/ok_opengv.h) followed by the result record 162
 (same layout as patch 0012). No computed value changes.

